  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Distinct, polished command-center aesthetic across all viewports: strong headline hierarchy, disciplined cyan/green/yellow accents, consistent mono labels, clean bordered surfaces, and convincing responsive reflow. Desktop composition is especially confident. Tablet and mobile remain coherent, but become very tall and text-dense; several micro-labels and muted secondary lines are visually undersized, while the horizontally clipped header navigation feels more constrained than intentional.",
